ide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> General RPG Resources: for any game, incl. Exalted<br /> Official Exalted Sources<br /> Character Sheets<br /> Exalted Fora (Forums)<br /> Canon information (Maps, Timelines, Calendars, canon characters, Great Houses)<br /> Creation's Writing Systems<br /> Game Aids and Software<br /> Exalted Advice (for STs and Players) and Tutorials<br /> Exalted Essence Resource Pages and Crunch Collections<br /> Exalted 3E Resource Pages and Crunch Collections<br /> Exalted 2E and/or 3E, or edition-agnostic, Resource Pages and Crunch Collections<br /> Exalted 2.0E-2.5E Resource Pages and Crunch Collections<br /> Exalted 1E-2E Resource Pages and Crunch Collections<br /> Exalted Resource Pages for 1E<br /> Adventures<br /> New Exalted Crunch<br /> New Charm Collections and Exalted-Host crunch, concepts, and house rules; and Charm-cascades<br /> Solar Charms and Crunch<br /> Sidereal Charms and Crunch<br /> Dragon-Blooded Charms and Crunch<br /> 2E Gaian Charms for Dragon-Blooded and/or Infernals (I haven't read these)<br /> Infernal Charms and Crunch<br /> Lunar Charms, Knacks, and Anima Powers<br /> Abyssal Charms and Crunch<br /> Exigent group concepts<br /> Alchemical Charms<br /> 2E Wiki Spirit Charms<br /> Fair Folk Charms and Crunch<br /> 2E Wiki Dragon King Paths<br /> New Artifacts<br /> New Artifact weapons, armor, and shields (3E)<br /> New Artifact weapons, armor, and shields (2E)<br /> New non-combat Artifacts<br /> New Hearthstones<br /> New and Alternate Magical Materials<br /> New mundane equipment<br /> New Martial Arts Collections and Initiations<br /> 3E Martial Arts (Terrestrial+Celestial)<br /> 1E-2E Terrestrial and Celestial Martial Arts<br /> Sidereal Martial Arts<br /> Sorcery, Necromancy, Thaumaturgy, and Alchemy<br /> Sorcery (3E)<br /> Sorcery (1E-2E)<br /> Necromancy<br /> Playing Heroic Mortals and God-Blooded<br /> New Locations and tribes in Creation<br /> Setting ideas and details for Creation<br /> Exalted and God-Blooded characters<br /> 3E Quick Characters<br /> New creatures of Creation and beyond<br /> New Behemoths (unknown or multiple origins)<br /> New Elementals and Elemental Courts, and 3E conversions<br /> New Fae and Wyld creatures and locations<br /> New Little Gods and Conversions<br /> New Darkbroods and Beneath locations<br /> Other new Creation-born creatures<br /> New Demons and Conversions<br /> Other new Malfean creatures and locations<br /> Yozis and Primordials<br /> New Yozis and Primordials<br /> Ghosts and Underworld creatures<br /> Underworld locations<br /> New Deathlord write-ups<br /> New Autochthonian creatures, locations, and setting ideas<br /> other Creatures<br /> other new Locations<br /> Exalted house rules, any Edition<br /> Exalted Essence house rules<br /> Exalted house rules 3E<br /> Exalted house rules, 1E-2E<br /> Exalted headcanons<br /> 3E Solar Rewrites<br /> 3E Sidereal Conversions<br /> 3E Dragon-Blooded Conversions (written before the official release)<br /> 3E Infernals Conversions<br /> 3E Lunar Conversions (written before the official release)<br /> Other 3E splat Conversions<br /> Alternative Abyssals<br /> 2E Splat Rewrites<br /> New Exalted Hosts and other splats<br /> Exalted chronicle records and quest records<br /> Exalted chronicle records and quest records (before the Age of Sorrows)<br /> Exalted Fanfiction<br /> Exalted Webcomics<br /> Exalted artwork, fanart<br /> Inspirational artwork and Inspirational media<br /> Exalted humor<br /> Alternate Exalted Rules systems (total overhauls)<br /> Shards<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 12-01-2021, 11:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-12T11:43:38-08:00","id":1467580,"title":"","content":"<u>Notes</u><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Just about every ShadownEssence project is unfinished and abandoned. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And currently SnE is completely offline <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> <li>Many of my own documents are color-coded. Usually black = canon, <span style=\"color:#800080\">violet = my headcanon, </span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">red = others\u2019 homebrew; </span>or my color code for each cWoD gameline. Some documents use glyphs from the Maya hieroglyph font, High Realm and Low Realm from Storyteller's Vault, WoD glyph and script fonts, and/or wingdings. None of the symbols are necessary (except for my font keys/guides) but they add some fun.</li> <li>For Archived copies of my Google Docs, if the listed url doesn\u2019t work, change it to <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://docs.google.com/document/d/\" target=\"_blank\">https://web.archive.org/web/*/https:...om/document/d/</a><b>[Doc ID]</b>/ or ask me for a new url (on this thread).</li> <li>Many of the urls in the Library have been Archived in the Wayback Machine, but the huge section in italics is stuff I haven't tried to Archive yet. Other exceptions are the Storyteller\u2019s Vault products (which aren\u2019t free); my Google Drive docs, the forums, Unofficial White Wolf Wiki, and Exalted Wikis (all of which I\u2019d like to save eventually); Sacred Texts (which is HUGE); most images, OneDrive, Google Sites, Dropbox, Mediafire, Tumblr, Pinterest galleries, most name generators, and some images and RP Nation threads (which the Internet Archive can\u2019t save).</li> <li>Most of the pages I have found are in English; most exceptions are noted.</li> </ol><br /> <u>Fonts</u><br /> Ancient Maya basic hieroglyph font (useable for Old Realm, with some adjustment for glyph placement and missing glyphs) <a href=\"http://rpm.pbone.net/index.php3/stat/4/idpl/29144350/dir/opensuse/com/maya-fonts-4.11-3.1.noarch.rpm.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpm.pbone.net/index.php3/stat...oarch.rpm.html</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":".  Mods say that posting links to other websites is not allowed 12-01-2021, 11:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-12T12:56:37-08:00","id":1467593,"title":"","content":"<b>EXALTED BOOKS</b><br /> <u>DriveThruRPG</u>, etc., where White Wolf and Onyx Path Publishing sell Exalted:<br /> * 3E: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?filters=45797_0_0_0_0&amp;keywords=exalted&amp;src=fid45797\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....d&amp;src=fid45797</a><br /> * 2E: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?filters=1820_0_0_0_0&amp;keywords=exalted&amp;src=fid1820\" target=\"_blank\">https://